  <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <tr>
      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-34bc450a-2424-4a4f-987c-f72443cd3701-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/07/13965307/7003678/cnmeeting2_crop.jpg" style="width: 100%; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="123" width="100%" height="auto"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/05/13752552/6943860/1_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="1" width="570" height="143"><p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 1em 0 15px;" align="center"><strong>The June Change Network meeting took place on Wednesday, June 24th from 2:30 p.m.- 4:00 p.m. at the testing center room in the Jerry Hammond Building.</strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">The Change Network held a "show and tell" icebreaker activity that provided an opportunity for members to get to know one another on a more personal level.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">The network then facilitated a group collaboration activity aimed at <strong>bringing our priority culture change initiatives to life</strong>. The group discussed action items, recommended first steps, and success measurements to drive <strong>Meaningful Collaboration</strong> across departments, an improved <strong>Employee Feedback</strong> process, and a formal <strong>Succession Planning</strong> solution.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Read more by checking out the <a href="https://columbusoh.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/StrategicRoadmapProject/Shared Documents/Change Support Network/Feedback %26 Insights/2026 Change Network Priority Culture Actions Feedback Summary%E2%80%8B.pdf?csf=1&e=SiMZLn&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&web=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">June - Culture Actions &amp; Feedback Summary</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Recommendations will be shared with city leadership to explore possibilities for citywide implementation.</p>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/05/13752604/6914762/2_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="2" width="570" height="143"><p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 1em 0 15px;"><strong>Continue to highlight the great work your colleagues are doing! </strong>Easily highlight and share out the great work that's happening in your departments by using the <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/019db14ead2b7ea29e7e8d474c27d38f?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">Work Spotlight Request Form (Smartsheet).</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">You can now reach us at our <strong>new network email address</strong>- feel free to email us anytime! ChangeNetwork@columbus.gov</p>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/06/13832208/6947249/whatsnext_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="What's Next" width="570" height="143"><h2 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 22px; margin: 0.83em 0 18px;"><em>Coming Up Next!</em></h2>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 1.4;"><strong>No Change Network Meeting in July.</strong></span></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">After conversations with leadership, we have made the decision to follow suit with Cabinet, Monthly Strategic Session, and City Council and cancel July's Change Support Network meeting. We were looking at lower than normal attendance this month based on vacations and summer plans as well, so this ensures alignment and gives folks a much-needed mid-summer break.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">We'll resume with our next monthly meeting <strong>Aug 19th. </strong>Please reach out if you have any questions.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;"> </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>Additional Resource Links</strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;"><a href="https://columbusoh.sharepoint.com/sites/StrategicRoadmapProject/SitePages/ProjectHome.aspx?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">Strategic Roadmap Sharepoint site</a></li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">We welcome your suggestions! Submit ideas and feedback <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/684b71436ff644f4ac42d6059f621808?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">HERE</a>!</li>
</ul>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 1em 0 15px;" align="center">We hope you all enjoy a beautiful July!</p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center">Thank you for all that you are doing to help foster prosperity for all who call Columbus home! As always, we invite and encourage you to reach out with any questions or suggestions.  </p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center">Change Support Network Operational Team</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/05/13752867/6914778/logistic-email-header_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="2" width="570" height="190">
</td>
