<div id="abe-column-block-34bc450a-2424-4a4f-987c-f72443cd3701" class="abe-column-block" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="168535281" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;">
  <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <tr>
      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-34bc450a-2424-4a4f-987c-f72443cd3701-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/06/13816873/6947247/maycnmeeting2_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="May Change Network picture" width="570" height="196"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/05/13752552/6947248/1_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="1" width="570" height="143"><p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 1em 0 15px;" align="center"><strong>The May Change Network meeting took place on Wednesday, May 20th from 2:30 p.m.- 4:00 p.m. at Jerry Hammond.</strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;">
<span class="cf0" style="line-height: 1.4;">The group discussed difficult conversations and upward and lateral feedback techniques to help embody our Core Values and strengthen a culture of collaboration. </span>We then put these strategies into practice by working through real conversations and everyday scenarios together.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">
<span class="cf0" style="line-height: 1.4;">Thank you to HR</span><span class="cf0" style="line-height: 1.4;">’</span><span class="cf0" style="line-height: 1.4;">s Citywide Training Team for sharing their expertise and equipping the group with strategies and skills to bring back to their departments.</span>
</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">If you couldn’t attend the meeting, explore your own conversations using Citywide Training’s <a href="https://columbusoh.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/StrategicRoadmapProject/Shared Documents/Strategic Help Resources/CTD Guide on How to Navigate Difficult Conversations.pdf?csf=1&e=jjNMGI&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&web=1" target="_blank" title="CTD Guide on How to Navigate Difficult Conversations" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">Guide on How to Navigate Difficult Conversations!</a>
</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Meeting materials have been uploaded to Sharepoint <em>(</em><a href="https://columbusoh.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/StrategicRoadmapProject/Shared Documents/Change Support Network/Change Network Meetings/05.20.26 Change Support Network Meeting.pdf?csf=1&e=HwAMpQ&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&web=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">05.20.26 Change Support Network Meeting pdf</a>)</li>
</ul>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/05/13752604/6914762/2_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="2" width="570" height="143"><ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;">This <strong>Monthly Recap</strong>! A new regular communication sent at the end of each month that captures all you want to know in one place.</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">The feedback you provided during the April meeting, focusing on Employee Support, has been compiled into a <strong>feedback summary </strong>report, outlining key themes and your direct insights. Feel free to share and explore ideas of how you can support employees further in your area. <em>(</em><a href="https://columbusoh.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/StrategicRoadmapProject/Shared Documents/Change Support Network/Feedback %26 Insights/2026 Change Network Employee Support Feedback Summary.pdf?csf=1&e=5JRhd5&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&web=1" target="_blank" title="2026 Change Network Employee Support Feedback Summary" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">Employee Support Feedback Summary</a><em>)</em>
</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px;">A new<strong> Work Spotlight Request Form </strong>was created to easily highlight and share the great work happening in your departments. This <a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/019db14ead2b7ea29e7e8d474c27d38f?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">Smartsheet form</a> is an easy way to indicate an interest in sharing more on an area of work &amp; if the network can support and enhance your efforts. </li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<strong>You Said/We Did</strong> progress updates will now be uploaded to Sharepoint and listed in this newsletter for your easy reference. (<a href="https://columbusoh.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/StrategicRoadmapProject/Shared Documents/Change Support Network/Feedback %26 Insights/You Said_We Did Progress Updates/YouSaid_WeDidMay2026.pdf?csf=1&e=3fhhIe&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&web=1" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #1D5782;">YouSaid_WeDidMay2026.pdf</a>)</li>
</ul>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/06/13832208/6947249/whatsnext_crop.jpg" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="What's Next" width="570" height="143"><ul style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0px;">The next Change Network meeting will be on <strong>Wed, June 24th 2:30-4:00PM at Jerry Hammond (1111 E Broad St) Testing Room 232.</strong>
</li>
<li style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Core Value Badge Cards have been distributed during recent meetings. If you haven’t been able to attend or have not yet received yours, please reach out and we’ll make sure you get one!</li>
</ul>
